Short:      a Mailreader for TransAmiga and MailManager
Kurz:       Ein Mailreader fuer TransAmiga und MailManager
Uploader:   Helmut.Steeg@tuebingen.netsurf.de (Helmut Steeg)
Author:     Helmut.Steeg@tuebingen.netsurf.de (Helmut Steeg)
Type:       comm/bbs
Replaces:   mailreader.lha
Version:    1.1

This is a small program in ARexx, which gives you a graphical user-
interface for a TransAmiga BBS. You can use it, when you also have
MailManager doing your Messagebase. You only need one Message-Area
for TransAmiga, the rest is done by the Skript and MailManager. Also,
you can change your areas from plain or indexed to e.g. compressed,
what makes your importing of messages a lot faster (from nearly 10
minutes before to about 1 minute, depending on the size of the packets).

It comes with a nice little GUI (Filescroller-like), and an ASCII-Mode.
This time i have included the english textfiles (thanks to Chris Quonoey
for reporting it *grin*). It is far from finished, but it is running :-)

One last note, which doesn't make it into the docs....
If there is an error, which ends the program when a textfile is being loaded,
delete the mailreader-user file. There was a little change in the userfile
(one line added), which is not recognized every time...
